  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.2', 'Matrices', 'What is the order of a matrix?', 'The number of rows × the number of columns.', 1),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.2', 'Matrices', 'When can two matrices be multiplied?', 'When the number of columns in the first equals the number of rows in the second.', 2),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.2', 'Matrices', 'Is matrix multiplication commutative?', 'No; in general AB ≠ BA.', 3),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.2', 'Matrices', 'Is matrix multiplication associative?', 'Yes: (AB)C = A(BC).', 4),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.2', 'Matrices', 'What is the identity matrix I?', 'A square matrix with 1s on the leading diagonal and 0s elsewhere; AI = IA = A.', 5),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.2', 'Matrices', 'What is the determinant of a 2×2 matrix (a b; c d)?', 'ad − bc.', 6),
