  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Series', 'Find the series for eˣ sin x up to x³.', '(1 + x + x²/2)(x − x³/6) = x + x² + x³/3 + …', 24),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Series', 'Find the series for ln(1 − x) up to x³.', '−x − x²/2 − x³/3.', 25),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Series', 'What is the validity of ln(1 − x)''s series?', '−1 ≤ x < 1.', 26),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Series', 'How can a Maclaurin series approximate a value?', 'Substitute a small x into the first few terms, e.g. e^0.1 ≈ 1 + 0.1 + 0.005.', 27),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Series', 'How can series find limits?', 'Replace functions with their series and simplify, e.g. lim (sin x)/x = 1.', 28),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Series', 'Find lim (x→0) of (1 − cos x)/x².', '(x²/2 − …)/x² → 1/2.', 29),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Series', 'Find lim (x→0) of (eˣ − 1)/x.', '(x + x²/2 + …)/x → 1.', 30),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.5', 'Further Calculus', 'What is an improper integral?', 'An integral where a limit is infinite or the integrand is undefined at a point in the range.', 1),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.5', 'Further Calculus', 'How do you evaluate ∫₁^∞ 1/x² dx?', 'lim (t→∞) [−1/x]₁ᵗ = 1.', 2),
  ('Further Mathematics', 'AQA', 'alevel', '1.5', 'Further Calculus', 'Does ∫₁^∞ 1/x dx converge?', 'No; ln t → ∞, so it diverges.', 3),
